window.products.push({"id":1189071,"name":"JOYJOM PCI-e 5.0 12VHPWR 16Pin Right Angle Adapter Female to Male Extension Cable, 16AWG 600W 12VHPWR 90 Degree Adapter for Graphic Card GPU 12+4pin R","category":"electronics","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zYBQvkxwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Designed for RTX 3090 Ti / 4070 Ti / 4080 / 4090】JOYJOM PCIe 5.0 12+4pin 16PIN Female to Male extension cable is designed for GeForce RTX 3090Ti 4070 Ti 4080 4090 GPU , Please check the orientation of your GPU before purchase. 【90 Degree 16(12+4)Pin Male for GPU】There are 2 directions of the connector, please check your gpu interface and our picture to choose correct cable, Right Agngle allows the cable to have a suitable extension direction, which can avoid the wear of the cable and the input port of GPU, extend the service life 【16AWG+24AWG 600W】Made by standard tinned copper wire, supports up to 600W output. The plug terminals of the graphics card cable are made of alloy copper and tinned material, which can bring stable and higher currents 【Package Include】1PCS 16(12+4) Pin Feamle to Male Extension Cable 5.9inch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zYBQvkxwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYJOM","source_asin":"B0BWDRZGC4","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189071","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWDRZGC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWDRZGC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1189072,"name":"EM10 IV Screen Protector for Olympus E-M10 Mark iv/ iiii/ ii EM5 MKII E-PL9 E-PL8 E-PL7 (3 Pack), WH1916 Tempered Glass Anti-Scratch Anti-Bubble","category":"electronics","retail price":7.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718uh+LAYlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thank you for purchasing this excellent screen protector. I will guide you through the installation and answer any questions by email,The process is divided into four steps: 1) cleaning your touch screen by using the green \"1\" (wet) and red \"2\" (dry) wipes. Touch ONLY the edges of the screen with your fingers since the oil from your fingers may cause problems.2) remove dust from your touch screen with the blue \"dust absorber\" stickers. These are really sticky, and you should hold them only by the end or tab--not the middle. Use the straight stickers for the edges of your screen, and the round sticker for the main part of the screen. 3) (please see included diagram) separate the protective screen--the THICK screen, which will soon be applied to your touch screen--from the THIN protective layer. Hold on to the black tab and pull gently from one corner diagonally across to the opposite corner OR straight across if you're really good with your hands. Now you have the solid screen protector ready to apply. Again, handle the screen ONLY by its edges, and place it carefully on your clean touch screen. As you apply GENTLE pressure to the surface of your touch screen protector, you will see the screen turn from gray to black, showing that contact has been made. 4) Wipe gently , using a SOFT cloth (not paper towels, since they can scratch) from the center outward until your new screen protector is attached completely to your touch screen. You now have protected your touch LCD screen from potential harm.Congratulations! Package Content: 3X Tempered Glass Film for Olympus OM-D E-M10 E-M5 E-PL9 E-PL8 E-PL7 Digital Camera. 3X Wet Cleaning Paper. 3X Dry Cleaning Paper. 3X Dust-absorber.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718uh+LAYlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WH1916","source_asin":"B071S8JYS8","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189072","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071S8JYS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B071S8JYS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
