window.products.push({"id":1189133,"name":"Pyle PMKSPAD2 Anti-Theft Tablet Security Stand Kiosk - Flexible Adjustable Floor Standing Gooseneck Tablet Case Holder Display with Phone Holder, LED ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tlkXDx30L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The PMKSPAD2 is an innovative new stand with a flexible gooseneck mount. It fits virtually any tablet from 8 to 10 inches in size. Just secure your tablet to the device and start using your favorite apps. It's great for reading in bed, listening to music, browsing the internet, watching video - You name it. The metal hose rotates a full 360 degrees for viewing at any angle. There's also a USB port to charge your device (requires your device's USB charger). a high-brightness LED lamp lets you always find your way in the dark. From the Manufacturer Versatile Tablet Stand! Click here for a larger image Universal iPad/Tablet Stand Click here for a larger image Perfect for Performances On-Stage or Off Click here for a larger image Multi-Angle/Orientation and Adjustable Gooseneck Click here for a larger image Powerful LED Lamp with Dimmer Switch Click here for a larger image Hands-Free Universal iPad Stand The PMKSPAD2 is an innovative tablet PC stand that allows you to securely hold your iPad in a predetermined position. The universal stands comes equipped with a multi-orientation swivel gooseneck, LED lamp, adjustable tablet holder with locking mechanism and iPod/MP3 holder. Use it in any room in the house from the bathroom to the bedroom! Enjoy your iPad like never before as the stand holds your tablet in place while you sit, stand or even lay down while enjoying full functionality of your device. Whether you use it for work or play, this stand has a wide range of uses. It's perfect for reading a script or music notes in studio or for on-stage performances. Use your iPad as a display screen for lyrics or notes while you talk or sing -it also makes for a great exercise buddy while running on the treadmill! Compatibility The universal tablet floor stand has an adjustable device clamp that safely and securely holds any tablet PC from 8 to 10.1 inches. The locking clamp mechansim easily slides to grasp your device without causing damage and allows you to position your tablet exactly how you want it. The iPod/MP3 player compartment can hold just about any iPod, iPod Touch and many other MP3 players. LED Lamp This versatile tablet stand comes with a built-in multiple bulb LED lamp and doubles as a night light. Control the lamp with switch and dimmer to set the mood! Multi-Angle Adjustment Precise positioning can be achieved for optimal viewing. Don't strain your body or your eyes -let the stand do the work. Swivel, rotate and turn the gooseneck so you can have a comfortable and more enjoyable experience. Worry-Free Safety The durable, reliable and sturdy construction with sure-grip touch points will safely hold your iPad/tablet in position once you've set your desired mounting location. Quick and Easy Setup Have your tablet mounted and begin enjoying the benefits of the universal stand in no time. This unit is lightweight and easy assembly will allow you to configure and transport with ease. About Pyle The Pyle line includes a wealth of products and accessories designed to enrich your media experiences at home and on the go. Start with your home theater, the entertainment center of any modern house. Pyle has projectors, TVs, mounts, and stands, just to get started--all fully equipped with state-of-the-art HD technology and compatible with next-generation devices and video game consoles like Xbox 360, PlayStation 3, and Wii, as well as your favorite Blu-ray players, for crisp, hi-res images. Then, upgrade your audio with speakers, receivers, subwoofers, MP3 docks, and so much more! Whether you want to upgrade your entertainment experience at home, at the gym, in your car, or even your boat, Pyle has you covered! There's plenty more to keep you, your family, and friends entertained in the Pyle line. Accessories for your iPod like bass-expanding mini speakers that run on rechargeable batteries and play your digital music, wherever you go or even waterproof cases that will leave you feeling worry-free. Perfect for the dorm room or sitting by the pool. Of course, Pyle also carries all types of cables and adapters you need for a fully operational setup that's sure to be the envy of your neighbors. Vintage turntables that get the look of yesterday’s classic phonographs with today's high-quality manufacturing standards and technology. Are you always on the move? Treat yourself to some comfort and style with noise-canceling headphones. We can't forget about Pyle's Power amplifiers, horn speakers, and waterproof speakers for your garden. Not to mention, tripods and speaker stands. Pyle Home has it all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tlkXDx30L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pyle","source_asin":"B009WGPCOW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189133","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009WGPCOW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B009WGPCOW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
