window.products.push({"id":1189198,"name":"8K Fiber Optic HDMI Cable 33ft, Ultra High Speed 48Gbps Active HDMI 2.1 Cable [8K@60Hz, 4K@120Hz], Support Dynamic HDR, eARC, Dolby Atmos, HDCP 2.3, C","category":"electronics","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k7AMPUVcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨ Note: Fiber HDMI Cable is a one-way transmission, \"SOURCE\" plug for connecting HDMI source (Blu-ray, Xbox, PS5, etc.). \"DISPLAY\" plug for connecting your HDMI display device(TV, Projector, etc.). So please make sure you correctly plug each end then to get a signal through the cable (if not then you’ll get no image from your device). 🚀【Hyper HD 48Gbps HDMI Fiber Cable】 8K HDMI Fiber Optic Cable fully meets the HDMI 2.1 standard, which takes you into the ultra-HD era that is four times the human eye, clearly displays every particle, and accurately processes every signal source. It provides the ultra-resolution of 7680*4320, making your world clearer and more real. 🚀【Dynamic HDR Support】 Dynamic HDR ensures every moment of a video is displayed at its ideal values for depth, detail, brightness, contrast, and wider color gamuts on a scene-by-scene or even a frame-by-frame basis. No signal loss. Compatible with Dolby Atmos, Dolby Vision, HDCP 2.2 & 2.3, DTS:X, Dynamic HDR, BT.2020, eARC, ALLM, QFT, QMS, VRR. Backward compatible with earlier versions of HDMI. 🚀【A Good Helper for Gamers】 Fiber HDMI cable supports the newest gaming features including Variable Refresh Rate (VRR) and Auto Low Latency Mode (ALLM) as specified in HDMI 2.1 for tear-free and lag-free gaming. Enhanced refresh rate features ensure an added level of smooth and seamless motion and transitions for gaming, movies and video. 🚀【Light And Flexible-Premium Materials】 Designed and built with 24K gold plated plug offer better corrosion resistance and enhanced signal transfer. The high-quality Zinc Alloy metal connectors for better insulation. Transfer the signal using light that completely eliminates RFI, EMI, and ground loop interference. Plug and play, without an external power supply. The fiber HDMI conductor is made of hybrid pure glass and OFC wires, does not violently pull the cable itself. ⚠️ When connecting your PC with graphics cards such as (RTX3060,3070,3080,3090 Series) and AMD(RX 6600,6700,6800,6900 Series) to 8K UHD TV. Remember to turn on the deep color function of TV sets(\"HDMI Ultra HD Deep Color\"). For the PC settings, be sure to choose the right Refresh rate: 3840x2160@120Hz and turn on HDR function(\"Display Setting\"→\"Advanced Display Settings\"→\"Windows HD Color\"→turn on \"Play HDR Games and Apps\"→OK), then you can enjoy your 4K@120Hz HDR games and videos.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k7AMPUVcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAXY","source_asin":"B0BRXC92HM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189198","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXC92HM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXC92HM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
