window.products.push({"id":1189287,"name":"Windows 10 Home 64 Bit OEM DVD ENGLISH","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DDuP47uWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Windows 10 is so familiar and easy to use, you'll feel like an expert. The Start menu is back in an expanded form, plus we'll bring over your pinned apps and favorites so they're ready and waiting for you. It starts up and resumes fast, has more built-in security to help keep you safe, and is designed to work with software and hardware you already have. The Windows Insider Program is a global community of fans who love Windows and want to help make it better. Insiders see the operating system in its earliest stages, and play a role in shaping it. Their feedback has contributed to the best Windows ever. Windows 10 comes with Microsoft Edge, an all-new browser that's built to give you a better web experience. Write2 or type notes directly on web pages and share them with others, read online articles free of distraction and save your favourite reads for later access. And with Cortana3 enabled, you get instant access to key actions - like making reservations or reading reviews - without leaving the page that you're on. Easily snap up to four apps in place and see all open tasks in a single view. You can even create virtual desktops when you need more space or want to group things by project. Introducing the new Windows Store, a unified shopping experience across every Windows 10 device. Browse the store on your PC, tablet, or phone and easily purchase great digital content including apps, games, music, movies, and TV shows. Cortana3 works across your day and your devices to help you get things done. By learning more over time, Cortana becomes more personal and useful to you. Cortana's also best at reminders, delivering them at the right time and place so you forget less and can do more. Box Contains 1 x DVD; 1 x License Key","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DDuP47uWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Microsoft","source_asin":"B01LZKNPUJ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189287","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZKNPUJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZKNPUJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
