window.products.push({"id":1189435,"name":"Ione Scorpius M10 USB Mechanical Keyswitch Keyboard","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lyjm3t-CL._AC_.jpg","description":"Scorpius M10 is by far the best mechanical keyboard that you could get in today's market. This is a classic keyboard with mechanical keyswitch. Perfect key clicking for those who enjoyed the old days classic keyboard. There's just something nice about the feel of a mechanical switch keyboard. The tiny snap you feel through your fingertips and the subtle click you hear confirms each keystroke. It's instant tactile and audible feedback for your keyboarding. Includes USB to PS/2 adapter. this is a keyboard that will last you for ages...order them today! System requirements: compatible PC Windows 98/2000/ME/XP/Vista","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lyjm3t-CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global Marketing Partners","source_asin":"B000UC1W3C","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189435","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000UC1W3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000UC1W3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1189436,"name":"Olympus E-PM1 Digital Camera Kit - Black - M.Zuiko MSC ED m14-42mm F3.5/5.6 II R Black Lens, 8GB SD Memory Card, Spare BLS-1 Lithium-Ion Rechargeable ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31F5Cu0c1AL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Olympus E-PM1 Digital Camera with 14-42mm Lens (Black) starts you out with everything you need to take great photographs, from day one. As the name states, you'll receive both the E-PM1 camera body and the Micro Four Thirds M.Zuiko MSC Digital ED m14-42mm zoom lens (black lens). In addition, a number of essential accessories come included as well, such as a lithium-ion battery and battery charger.Whether you're simply looking to lighten your load when it comes to photographing or you're an avid fan of the Micro Four Thirds genre, Olympus's PEN series of cameras provide you with a more lightweight option than full-sized DSLR rigs, but with numerous bells and whistles that still provide flexibility and creativity, far beyond that of a point-and-shot. With the Micro Four Thirds lens mount, you can choose from a number of optional lenses for the E-PM1 to suit your particular shooting style.At the center of the image making is the generous 3.0\" LCD. Used for composition and review of your footage, not to mention navigating the menu and for features such as Live View, this big, bright display features 460K pixels and the platform with which to compose your next great shot or epic short film. Of course, the 12.3Mp sensor and the TruePic VI image processor are the heart of the camera, taking what you see on the LCD screen and turning it into memories that will last a lifetime.In addition to shooting JPEG and RAW stills, along with 3D stills in the MPO form","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31F5Cu0c1AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLYMPUS","source_asin":"B005Q38CB0","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189436","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005Q38CB0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B005Q38CB0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
