window.products.push({"id":1189490,"name":"VideoSecu Ceiling Mount for 37\"-65\" LCD LED Plasma TV Flat Panel Screen, Some LED Models up to 70\" 75\" 1XC","category":"electronics","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ta-cd6fyL._AC_.jpg","description":"This heavy duty ceiling mount offers 15 degree of adjustable forward tilt and 360 degree pan to conveniently adjust the viewing angle. This mount fits most midsize to large TV. Will This mount Fit my flat panel? First check the weight of your TV. It must be less than 132 lbs. Second, look at the back panel of your TV. If your TV has 4 holes on the back of the screen, measure the vertical and horizontal distance between the holes, If the vertical distance is within 2.95 inch to 17.7 inch, horizon distance within 28 inch, then this bracket will fit. If you currently have a stand attached to your LCD TV this is usually removed prior to fitting the wall mount. Third, your TV should be 37\" or above. Otherwise the mount is too wide to hide behind your TV.Notice: This mount fits most 37-49\" TVs, do not work for some 55-75 inch TVs manufactured 2013 years ago.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ta-cd6fyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VideoSecu","source_asin":"B000WXEKBA","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189490","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000WXEKBA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000WXEKBA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1189491,"name":"GoPro HERO7 Silver + PNY Elite-X 32GB microSDHC Card Adapter-UHS-I, U3 - Waterproof Digital Action Camera with Touch Screen 4K HD Video 10MP Photos Li","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M44rWO1EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GoPro HERO7 - Meet HERO7, the perfect camera for adventures big and small. It’s built tough and totally waterproof—just grab it and go for it. Smooth 4K video and vibrant WDR photos make every moment look amazing. GPS lets you track how fast, high and far you went 4K30 Video - Get stunning 4K video that’s as amazing as the moment itself. You can also shoot time lapse videos to turn longer events into short, shareable moments. Rugged + Waterproof - Share experiences you can’t capture with your phone. HERO7 is tough, tiny, totally waterproof—and up for any adventure. Intuitive Touch Screen - With a touch screen and simple, streamlined capture modes, it’s easy to jump right in and get great shots. Just swipe and tap. Voice Control - Stay in the moment. Control your HERO7 hands free with voice commands like “GoPro, take a photo” and “GoPro, start recording.” 10MP Photos With WDR - HERO7 Silver takes beautiful, vibrant 10MP photos—even in challenging shots that mix bright light and shadows. And with Burst mode, you can get 15 photos in one second. Video Stabilization - Adios shaky footage. HERO7 Silver records smooth, steady video whether you’re skiing, snorkeling or chasing your dog around the yard. Shoot Vertically - Capture photos and videos in portrait orientation—perfect for your Snapchat and Instagram Stories. Photo Timer - A photo timer makes it easy to grab a GoPro selfie or group shot with your whole crew in the frame. Card Adapter-UHS-I, U3 4K Ultra HD ready - V30 video speed class makes PNY Elite-X microSD card ideal for 4K recording and streaming. 4K picture rate of 4096x3072pix. Amazingly Fast - Transfer speed of up to 100MB/s, so that you are always ready for the next video or photo, no more buffering, no more waiting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M44rWO1EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoPro","source_asin":"B07XZK2S9C","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189491","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XZK2S9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XZK2S9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
