window.products.push({"id":1189673,"name":"ECEEN Solar Case with 5W Solar Panel Charger & 5000mAH Battery Pack Hard Shell Carrying Bag with EVA Shockproof Foam Ideal for Travel or Home Storage ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B9m0+zghL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"ECEEN, Share the Sun! Where there is sunlight, there is endless power! Why ECEEN Solar Charger Gopro Case? Not only a Gopro case, but also a portable charger for your GoPro cameras. With ECEEN 5 Watts solar panel charger: ECEEN solar charger constructed of solar cells, high efficiency up to 22% efficiency. The high conversion solar charging technology keeps the battery powered up with free solar power. With ECEEN 5000mAH battery pack: ECEEN waterproof battery pack can storage energy from solar in the daytime. It is also rechargeable via USB charging cable from computer (or AC USB adaptor plug). Do not worry about your Gopro cameras running out of juice! How to use Charging the battery 1.Charging from the solar panel.  When you go outside with ECEEN Solar Charger Gopro Case and put solar panel face directly to the sunlight. The battery red led light will turn on automatically, it means that solar panel is charging internal battery.  2.Charging from computer or USB AC charger.  Using ECEEN original charging cable in the package. Plug USB plug to computer (or AC USB adaptor plug).Then the battery led will become red. When the battery fully charged, the four lights will become blue. Charging device Using USB charging cable, plug USB port to the battery. Connected right charging adaptor to your Gopro cameras.then the battery will be charging Gopro cameras automatically. Specifications: Case Size: 290*220*70mm/11.4*8.7*2.8Inches Net Weight: 30.3oz/860g Packing Size: 320*235*70mm/12.6*9.3*2.8 Inches Packing Weight:35.3oz/1000g PACKAGE CONTENT 1PC*ECEEN Solar Charger Gopro Case with 5000mAH battery pack 1PC* Micro USB cable 1PC* Caribiner 1PC* Instruction manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B9m0+zghL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECEEN","source_asin":"B01K4DEQJI","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189673","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K4DEQJI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K4DEQJI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
