window.products.push({"id":1189746,"name":"Silicon Power 64GB Marvel M70 High Speed USB 3.0 Flash Drive, Silver (SP064GBUF3M70V1S)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dY9vTRtHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Silicon Power Marvel M70 is the ultimate high speed retractable USB 3.0 flash drive! The Marvel M70 offers a cool and curvy metallic casing with a maximum read and write speed of 240 and 80 MB/sec, a real time-saving storage device when transferring large media files. With its sleek lidless design and retractable USB connector, the Marvel M70 is compact and convenient to carry around. It is also built-in with the LED indicator, indicating the data transfer status during use. SP Marvel M70 comes in multiple choices of storage capacities including 32GB, 64GB and 128GB. All Silicon Power USB flash drive products come with a lifetime warranty, SP Widget application software which provides seven major back up and Recover recovery tool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dY9vTRtHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SP Silicon Power","source_asin":"B00LN0P12I","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189746","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LN0P12I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LN0P12I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1189747,"name":"Kaito KA300 Solar/Hand Crank AM/FM Emergency Radio with Digital Alarm Clock, Cell Phone Charger & 3-LED Flashlight","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ASft36NOL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the manufacturer: 4-way powered emergency world band radio Solar power 5V DC Hand crank generator Rechargeable battery : Supplies power to the radio & stores power The KA300 is designed for both everyday use & emergency preparedness applications. It offers different methods to keep you informed including 5V DC (USB cable included), the built-in rechargeable Ni-MH battery that can be charged by a computer, hand cranking and the built-in solar panel, which provides power for the radio even when there’s no battery installed. The KA300 has an AM/FM tuner with a digital back-lit display showing the frequency number. When the radio is off, the display turns into a 12-hour digital alarm clock.  At the heart of the KA300, there is a dynamo generator that recharges the internal replaceable Ni-MH battery pack and powers the radio and the flashlight. In addition, the radio features a combined power input/output jack to be used to charge cell phones or other compatible portable devices. Therefore you can always have the peace of mind that you will be able to make a phone call even in the most desperate situation.  With its revolutionary design and versatile functions, it’s not only an ideal choice of a portable bedside clock radio but also an indispensable tool for emergency preparedness purposes, travelling, camping, backpacking and other outdoor activities. Specifications: FM: 87 - 108 MHz  AM: 520 -1620 KHz  Internal speaker  Headset jack socket: 3.5 mm  DC IN/OUT (combined)  Rechargeable batteries: 3.6V Ni-MH batteries 300mAh  Dimensions: 6 ¼ X 2 ½ X 3 inches  Weight: 10.7 oz What’s in the box: KA300 emergency radio  USB charging cable (for charging internal battery via a computer)  Connection cable  User manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ASft36NOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kaito","source_asin":"B0097CY0LM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189747","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0097CY0LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0097CY0LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
