window.products.push({"id":1189785,"name":"ASUS TUF Gaming A15 Gaming Laptop, 15.6” 144Hz Full HD IPS-Type Display, AMD Ryzen 5 4600H, GeForce GTX 1650 Ti, 8GB DDR4, 512GB PCIe SSD, RGB Keyboar","category":"electronics","retail price":853.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1A2yQlAXCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ASUS TUF Gaming A15 FA506 is a powerful Windows 10 gaming laptop that combines gaming performance with up to a narrow bezel 144Hz IPS-type panel and an extended lifespan, thanks to its patented Anti-Dust Cooling (ADC) system. Equipped with NVIDIA GeForce graphics, multi-core AMD Ryzen processor, and solid-state storage - FA506 is able to play the latest games and multitask with ease. FA506 features one of the fastest Wi-Fi standards available — the latest Intel Wave 2 Wi-Fi 5 (802.11ac) boasts data transfer rates of up to an incredible 1.7Gbps. To top it all off, it’s backlit gaming keyboard is rated at 20-million keystroke durability. The actual transfer speed of USB 3.0, 3.1, 3.2 (Gen 1 and 2), and/or Type-C will vary depending on many factors including the processing speed of the host device, file attributes and other factors related to system configuration and your operating environment. For Free Windows 11 upgrade eligible devices, visit ASUS Windows 11 website for more information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1A2yQlAXCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASUS","source_asin":"B0BGM56T4K","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189785","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGM56T4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGM56T4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1189786,"name":"MartinLogan Purity Fully-Powered Hybrid Electrostatic Loudspeaker (Single, Cherry) (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31scar3yJtL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Product Description Coming From the Manufacturer MartinLogan - The Great American Speaker Company Since 1983 MartinLogan, the great American speaker company, has hand-crafted high performance electrostatic speakers. Their award-winning designs, advanced technologies, and outstanding customer service have long made MartinLogan's amazingly detailed speakers a must have for home theater and music lovers around the world. Purity's (shown here in dark cherry) graceful stylingintegrates great sound with any home decor Purity connects directly to devices with variable volume level control,such as MP3 players, or connects to traditional amplifiers and receivers Purity: World Class Performance with New Generation Connectivity Purity is an internally powered hybrid design descended from Martinlogan's legendary, ultra performing enthusiast models. Purity represents a remarkable achievement in performance and 21st century connectivity at a really amazing price. Executing an exciting new direction, Purity is an elegant compact floor standing beauty that does it all. Combining the latest, friendliest version of MartinLogan's unique see-through electrostatic panel (world's most accurate method of sound reproduction) with 2 deep bass woofer cones in a clean lined cabinet, Purity mates ideally with any electronics for any audio use. Purity is at its best when directly connected with an RCA cable from any device with a volume control. Your computer, TV, i-pod, pre-amp, and A/V receiver will all love the marriage. Of course you may hook-up using conventional speaker wire if your system so requires. Beyond delivering accurate play back of all types of stereo music, or incorporated as the star in your 5.1 or 7.1 Home Theater playing film soundtracks, Purity will look great in your entertainment space and provide years of performance and pride. Best of all is Purity's breakthrough low cost, allowing you to get unprecedented application versatility, superior build quality, a lifestyle object of art and truly exceptional sound - for a very ordinary price. Purity uses a host of recent improvements derived from its vaunted, more extreme brothers. For the technically inclined and the MartinLogan followers out there, we'll cover these new generation, in-house breakthroughs below. Purity is equipped with both RCA and traditional binding posts Purity connects directly to devices with variable volume level control,such as MP3 players, or connects to traditional amplifiers and receivers Prime Setup Features Ultimate Performance via RCA Connection To achieve ultimate performance with the Purity use of the RCA line level connection is recommended. With this input Purity is able to connect directly to devices with variable level control such as digital music players (MP3s, iPods), televisions, computers, multiroom digital music servers, and even the RCA line outs of your stereo and AV receivers, processors and pre-amps. What you accomplish with this method is the use of the Purity's cool running, great sounding, and precisely matched 200 watt internal amplifier. You will get the maximum control and loudness output from Purity. Additional speaker level inputs also allow Purity to connect using conventional speaker wire with more traditional power amps or stereo and A/V receivers. Swivel Base Allows Optimal Positioning Easily adaptable for different listening positions, Purity incorporates an innovative rotating and removable base allowing user adjustment to control vertical wave launch. You can fine tune the sound to match how you like to listen in your room. Energy Transfer Coupler Spikes and Toolless Binding Posts The Source is supplied with sturdy ¼-20 MiniETC spikes, which can be used in place of the standard feet to enhance stability on thick carpets or to create tighter coupling between the speaker and floor. MartinLogan's in-house, tool-less binding posts make cable connection management easy and precise. Electrostat panels ensure ultimate clarity High-rigidity woofers mean clean, tight bass Under the Hood: The Benefits of Electrostatic Panels CLS (Curvilinear Line Source Electrostatic Panel) For 25 years MartinLogan has led the speaker building world in refining what experts acknowledge as the most accurate sound reproducing technology, a way of recreating sound that has been known since the dawn of audio recording and replay: Electrostatic. The basic story is one of simply harnessing a force of nature, the world of charged particles. In their Lawrence, Kansas factory MartinLogan builds perforated, curved steel panels (stators) which are precisely insulated. They sandwich an ultra light weight membrane (diaphragm) of highly advanced, specifically treated film. When the sound signal from your audio receiver, comes through these voltage charged, elegant little structures, magic happens. Decades of research have allowed MartinLogan to bring forth these nearly indestructible, see-through panels with the ability to repr","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31scar3yJtL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MartinLogan","source_asin":"B000XSDHIQ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189786","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000XSDHIQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000XSDHIQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
