window.products.push({"id":1189893,"name":"Amplified HDTV antenna-WINTOP 50 Miles Range Digtial TV Antenna USB Power Supply - 13.2ft Long Coax Cable","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CrqoJts1L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Choose the Right Antenna Check the distance to the nearest broadcast towers to choose the right antenna. The number of channels you get is determined by what's being broadcast in your area, how far away you are from the towers, and your surroundings. We do offer a 30-day money back guarantee in order for you to test the suitability in your area (conditions apply). If customer cannot get a signal with the antenna not working as expected, how to do? a. At first, check to make sure you have correctly connected the antenna to your HDTV or third-party HD receiver b. Second, re-scan for the channels. In the TV's set up menu, set the mode to antenna or air. Refer to the Antenna TV manual for detailed instructions c. Reposition the antenna in a different location, facing the direction of the broadcast towers is usually the best. Channels reception depends on what's being broadcast towers in your area, how far away you are from towers, and your surroundings. You'd better try to put your tv indoor antenna on the higher location, like on the wall, better close to or on the window, and no obstacles between your home to Broadcast Towers. And turn around the antenna leaf to find the best reception direction, sometimes a few feet can make a big difference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CrqoJts1L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WINTOP","source_asin":"B072M51XF9","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1189893","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072M51XF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B072M51XF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
